# victory-stack-3.patch (part 3 of 3)
#
# The diff of the ScarlettPort VIctory-based runtime (runtime/victory) against its base:
#   git diff 4e17478 fx-cand4
# where 4e17478 is the tip of fxceless/victory-fork `main` that this work started from
# (GPL-3.0-or-later, https://github.com/fxceless/victory-fork) and `fx-cand4` @ efcc7b9 is
# that base plus merged community work (see runtime/victory/SCARLETTPORT.md) and our changes.
# Split in 3 parts (the repository keeps files under 2 MB). Apply all to a checkout of 4e17478 with:
#   git apply patches/victory-stack-*.patch
# (git apply ignores these leading comment lines.)
# This diff is generated from the tree in runtime/victory, so it carries the wording edits described in SCARLETTPORT.md.
# It does not include the ScarlettPort naming changes (version resource, window caption prefix).
